    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t01-mother-04-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第4题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t01-mother-04",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）某企业采购了A、B、C三个品牌的电脑共54台，其中采购A品牌电脑的台数比B品牌电脑少35%。问采购的C品牌电脑比B品牌电脑：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "少1台"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "少2台"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "多1台"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "多2台"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
